'''Lord Enma''' (閻魔大王, ''Enma-daiō'', '''Great King Enma''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Le'boin]] introduced in [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]]. He was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

