==Enemy==
This enemy is a Red [[Le'boin]] with a Red [[Doge]] rider, and higher health and attack damage than either. He is slower than Le'boin, takes longer to attack and has slightly less range, so you can safely use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] against him.

==Strategy==
As said before, you can use Dragon Cat and other long-ranged cats like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], or [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] to outrange and deal a lot of damage to Lord Enma. [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]] can tank many hits from him, allowing ranged attackers shown above and potentially [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Face Cat]] to enter his hitbox, freezing him temporarily or permanently if in [[True Form]]. With only one knockback, he can't be unfrozen until death.

